r-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462492}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "bf92f8df-b777-508f-9358-1b7029534cba" :question/math-academy-id "q-106900" :question/problem "Which of the following vector spaces has a dimension of $3?$\n- **I.** ${R}^{2}$\n- **II.** ${R}_{2}[t]$, the vector space of all polynomials in the variable $t$ of degree at most $2$\n- **III.** ${\\text{M}}_{3}(R),$ the vector space of all $3\\times 3$ matrices over $R$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's examine each of the vector spaces in turn.\n\n- Recall that $\\text{dim}({R}^{n})=n.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\text{dim}({R}^{2})=2\\ne 3.\\,\\times \n$$\n- Recall that $\\text{dim}({R}_{n}[t])=n+1.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\text{dim}({R}_{2}[t])=2+1=3.\\,✓\n$$\n- Recall that $\\text{dim}({\\text{M}}_{n}(R))={n}^{2}.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\text{dim}({\\text{M}}_{3}(R))={3}^{2}=9\\ne 3.\\,\\times \n$$\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"II only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186243977 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152220 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "aee17e3a-031d-5c0e-9488-17410b3a2372" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying True Statements About Dimensions of Vector Spaces"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "85f50e01-4432-5abc-a190-7e72cdc3873a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461479} {:answer/id #uuid "26b77efa-1ca5-50e3-a239-917ffd78fa11" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461480}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "85f50e01-4432-5abc-a190-7e72cdc3873a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461479} :answer-field/id #uuid "d618925b-ccec-5382-aafc-ee623f24eae3" :answer-field/key "I" :a